  "dev_notes": "Canonical ID Trans_Pit; displayed as The Moving Boundary. Flat ground-level study retained, no lethal pit restored. Three non-overlapping pusher lanes travel2m at (3,3)+Z, (7,3)+Z and (5,5)-Z. Their swept boxes stop before solid row2/6. An eastern bypass stays available. Rotation slabs and ball launchers remain; growers keep common .15-cycle/second timing and floor anchoring. Source fire tokens are disarmed by the current embedded museum; text describes observed obstacles, not a forced death trial. Finale added 2026-09-17: 8m frame with 9m wall collars: transformation_airlock at (7,29), floor origin, flat approach and exit runway. Exit t moved to (7,31). Door remains open while a visitor is in its clearance area, then reverses after three empty seconds. Existing simulation observation route remains available.",
